      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B2E4C74CC5D00020D560AC8CC6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이거 즐길 줄 모르는구만~\n언제라도 좋으니까 도전해 봐.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 368,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774AC700020C990AE380020C9040020BAA8B974B294AD6CB9CC007E000AC5B8C81CB77CB3C40020C88BC73CB2C8AE4C0020B3C4C804D5740020BD10002E001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "맨몸 서바이버로\n짜릿해져 보라구~!!!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
